@startuml esha_D10_consultation_sequence
autonumber
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam dpi 160
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2B6CB0
  ActorBorderColor #2B6CB0
  LifeLineBorderColor #4A5568
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #EDF2F7
  ParticipantBorderColor #2B6CB0
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EDF2F7
  ParticipantFontColor #1A202C
  ParticipantFontStyle bold
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FEFCBF
  BorderColor #B7791F
  FontColor #744210
  FontSize 12
}
title Proposed Consultation Analysis Sequence (D10)

actor Physician as Doctor
participant "Physician Application\nNext.js + FastAPI" as App
participant "Workflow\nOrchestrator" as Orchestrator
participant "Context and Specialist Agents\nMemory + Case + Imaging + Lab + Medication" as Specialists
participant "Review Agents\nEvidence + Reasoning + Critic" as Review
database "PostgreSQL\n+ pgvector" as DB

== Capture and confirmation ==
Doctor -> App : Start consultation capture (FR09)
App -> App : Transcribe into structured draft (FR11-FR12)
Doctor -> App : Confirm notes and multimodal inputs (FR13-FR16)
== Context and specialist analysis ==
Doctor -> App : Request proposal (FR26)
App -> Orchestrator : Start proposed workflow
activate Orchestrator
Orchestrator -> Specialists : Retrieve history and assemble case (FR19-FR20)
Specialists -> DB : Query records and semantic memory
DB --> Specialists : Relevant longitudinal context
Specialists --> Orchestrator : Consolidated case
par Multimodal analysis
  Orchestrator -> Specialists : Analyse image, labs and medications
  Specialists --> Orchestrator : Findings, trends and safety alerts
else Evidence retrieval
  Orchestrator -> Review : Retrieve cited guidelines (FR27)
  Review -> DB : Search evidence index
  DB --> Review : Relevant guideline passages
end
== Synthesis and physician review ==
Orchestrator -> Review : Synthesize draft with evidence (FR28-FR29)
Review -> Review : Safety and critic review (FR30)
Review --> Orchestrator : Draft + citations + critic findings
Orchestrator -> DB : Persist draft as PENDING
Orchestrator --> App : Return review package
deactivate Orchestrator
App --> Doctor : Display draft, citations and critic findings (FR31-FR32)
note over Doctor, App
  No proposal becomes a clinical decision or patient memory
  until explicit physician approval (UC05 / UC06).
end note
@enduml
